{{For|the Crazy Witch on {{Gamemode|Stranded}}|Crazy Witch (Stranded)}}
The '''Crazy Witch''' is a [[Spooky Mob]] that can only spawn during the [[Spooky Festival]] and from Trick or Treat boxes during the event. Like all [[Spooky Mobs]], they take 1 {{Stat|Damage}} per hit. It attacks by summoning up to 5 {{MobSprite|Witch's Bat}}s that deal {{Stat|True Damage|1}}. The witch itself doesn't do damage.

